Third-party data

data/catalogue.js is built from the OpenISD driver catalogue
(https://github.com/Johnlon/openisd), MIT licence: see data/OPENISD-LICENSE.txt.

data/catalogue-pe.js holds driver specifications read from the public
Parts Express product pages (via github.com/meowelectronics/parts-express-database),
each linking back to its page. Specifications and trademarks belong to their
makers.
